          "variation": "A",
          "name": "A Backlog",
          "subject": "{{first_name}}",
          "body": "<div>{{first_name}}, most {{custom_company_type}} are leaving money in denied submissions and aging accounts nobody has time to rework.</div><div><br></div><div>We work through that backlog every day so it stops sitting on your team's desk.</div><div><br></div><div>Worth a short call?</div><div><br></div><div>{{random|If not relevant, just reply no and I will not follow up|Not relevant? Just reply no and I will not follow up}}</div><div><br></div><div>{{random|- {{sender_first_name}} {{sender_last_name}}|- {{sender_first_name}}}</div>"
        },
        {
          "variation": "B",
          "name": "B Visibility",
          "subject": "{{first_name}}",
          "body": "<div>{{first_name}}, honest question — do you know how much is sitting in denied submissions and aging accounts at {{company_name}}?</div><div><br></div><div>We help {{custom_company_type}} clear that pile without your current team taking on more.</div><div><br></div><div>Worth a look?</div><div><br></div><div>{{random|If not relevant, just reply no and I will not follow up|Not relevant? Just reply no and I will not follow up}}</div><div><br></div><div>{{random|- {{sender_first_name}} {{sender_last_name}}|- {{sender_first_name}}}</div>"
        },
        {
          "variation": "C",
          "name": "C Admin Overhead",
          "subject": "{{first_name}}",
          "body": "<div>{{first_name}}, admin overhead is the hardest line item for most {{custom_company_type}} to keep flat as patient volume grows.</div><div><br></div><div>We handle scheduling, intake, credentialing, and account follow-up at roughly half the labor cost of adding someone locally — your processes stay the same.</div><div><br></div><div>Want to hear how that works for a practice like yours?</div><div><br></div><div>{{random|If not relevant, just reply no and I will not follow up|Not relevant? Just reply no and I will not follow up}}</div><div><br></div><div>{{random|- {{sender_first_name}} {{sender_last_name}}|- {{sender_first_name}}}</div>"
        },
        {
          "variation": "D",
          "name": "D Stretched Teams",
          "subject": "{{first_name}}",
          "body": "<div>{{first_name}}, your admin team is probably doing the work of two people.</div><div><br></div><div>We take scheduling, intake, documentation, and account follow-up off their plate so they can focus on patients again.</div><div><br></div><div>Is that something you're looking at this year?</div><div><br></div><div>{{random|If not relevant, just reply no and I will not follow up|Not relevant? Just reply no and I will not follow up}}</div><div><br></div><div>{{random|- {{sender_first_name}} {{sender_last_name}}|- {{sender_first_name}}}</div>"
        },
        {
          "variation": "E",
          "name": "E Before You Hire",
          "subject": "{{first_name}}",
          "body": "<div>{{first_name}}, when admin work piles up, most {{custom_company_type}} look at hiring another person locally.</div><div><br></div><div>We handle that same admin workload at roughly half the labor cost — without you posting another job.</div><div><br></div><div>Worth a conversation?</div><div><br></div><div>{{random|If not relevant, just reply no and I will not follow up|Not relevant? Just reply no and I will not follow up}}</div><div><br></div><div>{{random|- {{sender_first_name}} {{sender_last_name}}|- {{sender_first_name}}}</div>"
        },
