          "name": "F Bandwidth",
          "subject": "{{first_name}}",
          "body": "<div>{{first_name}}, your nurses and front desk shouldn't spend their day on scheduling, credentialing, intake, and paperwork.</div><div><br></div><div>We take that work off them so they stay focused on patients.</div><div><br></div><div>Curious how other practices are handling it?</div><div><br></div><div>{{random|If not relevant, just reply no and I will not follow up|Not relevant? Just reply no and I will not follow up}}</div><div><br></div><div>{{random|- {{sender_first_name}} {{sender_last_name}}|- {{sender_first_name}}}</div>"
